<section style="max-width:760px;margin:auto;padding:8vw 6vw"><p>OUKKA / BRAND STORY</p><h1>Design What Deserves to Stay</h1><p>OUKKA 從上海 DEQIU ART DISTRICT 出發，重新思考每天都會遇見的物件。我們相信，好的設計不需要喧嘩；它應該在使用中慢慢被理解，陪人走得更遠。</p><p>OUKKA begins in Shanghai’s DEQIU ART DISTRICT, rethinking the objects we meet every day. Good design reveals itself through use and stays for the long journey.</p></section>
